flowchart TD
    A[Request one specialist role] --> B{Input references empty?}
    B -->|Yes| EMPTY[Return empty validated result with no API call]
    B -->|No| READY{Live mode and configured provider?}
    READY -->|No| LOCAL[Use role-specific local behavior]
    READY -->|Yes| CONTEXT[Build bounded role context and JSON schema]
    CONTEXT --> RES[Estimate conservative request cost plus margin]
    RES --> TX[Atomic SQLite reservation: BEGIN IMMEDIATE]
    TX --> CAP{Fits remaining cumulative cap?}
    CAP -->|No| FALL[Record Fallback event and use local result]
    CAP -->|Yes| CALL[Call Fireworks with bounded output and timeout]
    CALL --> RESP{Response received with usable usage?}
    RESP -->|Yes| SET[Settle estimated cost using returned token counts]
    RESP -->|No or ambiguous failure| KEEP[Retain reservation for unknown billed usage]
    SET --> VALID{Normal finish, valid schema and exact allowed references?}
    VALID -->|Yes| OK[Accept result and record stage event]
    VALID -->|No| FALL
    KEEP --> FAIL{Response otherwise usable?}
    FAIL -->|Yes| VALID
    FAIL -->|No| FALL
